# Reference PDFs (references/): kept locally for the citation audit, but not pushed, because most are copyrighted.
# Only PDFs whose license allows redistribution are tracked (see references/DOWNLOAD_STATUS.md, "Copyright and git").
# Matched by author and year, so they survive renumbering.
references/**/*.pdf
!references/*Yazdani2021_*.pdf
!references/*Lillo2026_*.pdf
!references/*Cobb1990_*.pdf
!references/*Lee2019_PyWavelets*.pdf
!references/*Towers2024_*.pdf
!references/*Raffin2020_*.pdf
